  "descriptionHtml": "<div>Silver-tone stainless steel case with a black leather strap. Fixed silver-tone stainless steel bezel. Champagne dial with silver-tone hands and index hour markers. Minute markers. Tachymeter markings around the outer rim. Dial Type: Analog. Date display between the 4 and 5 o'clock positions. Chronograph - three sub-dials displaying:  60 second, 60 minute and 12 hour. Seiko Caliber 8T67 quartz movement. Scratch resistant Hardlex crystal. Pull / push crown. Solid case back. Round case shape, case size: 41.5 mm, case thickness: 12.1 mm. Band width: 22 mm. Tang clasp. Water resistant at 100 meters / 330 feet. Functions: date, hour, minute, second, tachymeter. Chronograph Series. Sport watch style. Watch label: Japan Movt. Seiko Chronograph Quartz Champagne Dial Men's Watch SSB383.</div>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600;\">Technical Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n    <tbody>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Brand</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Seiko</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Series</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Chronograph</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Model</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">SSB383</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #555;\">Gender</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; color: #222;\">Men's</td></tr>\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px 12px; font-weight: 600; width: 35